# W22-DB-ε: seed corpora are committed (load-bearing per ADR-079
# Pillar 1). Per-target subdirectories under `corpus/` carry hand-
# crafted named seeds (e.g., `01_simple_match.txt`,
# `03_canonical_v0.bin`) AND runtime-generated mutation files
# (libFuzzer appends SHA1-named coverage discoveries during runs).
# We track ONLY the hand-crafted seeds. The pattern below ignores
# the 40-char-hex SHA1 filenames libFuzzer emits and tracks
# everything else.
corpus/*/[0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f][0-9a-f]
